// The pipeline stages (plan P1-03; design T9 A3) — X-macro, read by
// engine/src/api/stages.h and by tools/gen-schema.mjs (settings `affects`).
// STAGE(id, side, unit, rerun)
//   side:  Engine | Host (the host runs Execute: the document program)
//   unit:  Doc | Pid (Emit runs per top-level block)
//   rerun: Once (its product is consumed or mutated downstream: changing an
//          input means rebuilding the document — tsr2_doc_fork)
//          PidRetry (re-run whole, per block, while metrics arrive)
//          Resumable (the pull loop: answers accumulate)
//          Reentrant (pure over earlier products: re-run in place)
//          Provisional (plan P3-28; design T6 S14: Reentrant, and it may
//          ask — a run that files a need, a host box at its width, is
//          provisional: never painted, re-run when the answers arrive)
STAGE(Compile, Engine, Doc, Once)
STAGE(Execute, Host, Doc, Once)
STAGE(Ingest, Engine, Doc, Once)
STAGE(Resolve, Engine, Doc, Once)
STAGE(BoxTree, Engine, Doc, Once)
STAGE(Emit, Engine, Pid, PidRetry)
STAGE(Measure, Engine, Doc, Resumable)
STAGE(Layout, Engine, Doc, Provisional)
STAGE(Paginate, Engine, Doc, Reentrant)
STAGE(Paint, Engine, Doc, Reentrant)
